Version 0.12 2026/11/04
  - Fix qr_save() crashes caused by invalid arguments.
  - qr_save() now returns false with a warning for invalid arguments,
    including null size or margin, negative margin, and images wider than
    1000000 pixels. Some of these calls used to return true.
  - Rejected qr_save() calls no longer truncate an existing file.
  - Fail in configure when png.h or libpng is missing.
  - Add function documentation in English and Traditional Chinese.

Version 0.11 2023/05/28
  - Fix temporary_file issue.

Version 0.10 2023/05/27
  - Fix with php8.1 or later (arginfo)

Version 0.9 2022/03/14
  - add php7 support back.

Version 0.8 2022/03/12
  - Add arginfo to make it works with php8.

Version 0.7 2020/10/27
  - Add php8 support.

Version 0.6 2016/08/26
  - remove deprecated TSRMLS_DC.

Version 0.5 2016/08/26
  - Add php7 support.

Version 0.4 2011/12/09
  - Coding style fix.
  - Add unittest.
  - Change qr_save api to make it flexible.
